{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"perl","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Perl","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Perl (.pl .pm .t).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"perl","name":"Perl","extensions":[".pl",".pm",".t"],"grammar":"grammars/perl.json","lineComment":"#","blockComment":["=pod","=cut"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Perl","path":"snippets/perl.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/perl.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"=pod\",\n      \"end\": \"=cut\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"`(?:[^`\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*`\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[$@%&][A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_:]*\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:wantarray|continue|foreach|package|require|return|unless|bless|break|elsif|local|until|while|else|eval|exit|goto|last|next|redo|and|die|for|not|our|sub|use|xor|do|if|my|no|or)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:__PACKAGE__|__FILE__|__LINE__)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:unshift|defined|reverse|sprintf|printf|splice|values|delete|exists|length|substr|print|shift|split|index|close|push|keys|each|join|grep|sort|open|say|pop|map)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/perl.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Shebang and strict\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pl\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"#!/usr/bin/env perl\",\n      \"use strict;\",\n      \"use warnings;\",\n      \"\",\n      \"$0\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A script header\"\n  },\n  \"Sub\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"sub\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"sub ${1:name} {\",\n      \"\\tmy (${2:\\\\$arg}) = @_;\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A subroutine\"\n  },\n  \"Foreach\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"fore\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"foreach my ${1:\\\\$item} (@${2:items}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"foreach\"\n  },\n  \"Hash loop\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"eh\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"for my ${1:\\\\$k} (sort keys %${2:h}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"Iterate a hash\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Perl\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Perl.\n\n## Files\n\n`.pl`, `.pm`, `.t`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `#`.\n- 4 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `pl` | A script header |\n| `sub` | A subroutine |\n| `fore` | foreach |\n| `eh` | Iterate a hash |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}